  ALTERNATE f= 7.6%: median z = 0.10 (10-90%: -1.21..+1.43)  [banked-floor s_FJ=0.15 would give 0.17]  P(z>=3) = 0.006
  ALTERNATE f=14.4%: median z = 0.20 (10-90%: -1.10..+1.53)  [banked-floor s_FJ=0.15 would give 0.38]  P(z>=3) = 0.006
  [OK] even the BEST corner (alt footing f=14.4%, banked floor) gives median z = 0.36 < 1.
  => ANY firing on the 23 in-hand carriers is EXPLORATORY/FIREWALLED: it can neither support nor
     kill (pre-derived power 0.1-0.6 sigma; matches the banked 2026-06-26 pilot expectation).

======================================================================================================
 (6) THE dE/BRIGHT-MEMBER BACKDOOR (Sohn+2017 A2029 specs) -- verified dead in the same MC
======================================================================================================
  A2029 usable (sigma>=60 km/s): 665 members, median frac err 0.10; dE-class predicted f~0.7%
  (adiabatic-dead, rederive sec 4) -> N_3sigma = 216,747 (median-z) vs 665 in the whole catalog:
  shortfall x326. No backdoor around the firewall through survey-measurable members.

======================================================================================================
 (7) SUBSTRUCTURE STRESS TEST -- the one confound that can fake b>0 under TRUE MG (cut, don't shuffle)
======================================================================================================
  MG truth + 15% coherent infalling-group members (shared +0.12 ln-sigma formation offset, +1.0 proxy
  offset), NO DS cut, N=900: median FAKE z = 2.36, P(fake z>=3) = 0.28
  same with the E1d DS-cut applied (groups excised):        median z = +0.03, P(z>=3) = 0.0008
  [OK] BOTH WAYS: without the substructure cut a 3-sigma 'MI detection' can be FAKED under true MG;
       the frozen E1d cut restores the exact null. A detection without the DS cut proves nothing.

======================================================================================================
 (8) VERDICT (rule E9, frozen above)
======================================================================================================
  POWERED NOW?   NO dataset qualifies. The entire public carrier reservoir is 23 cluster/group
    UDG sigmas (Gannon+2024) at ~24% errors, untagged: at TODAY'S errors + the MEASURED in-hand
    astro floor (s_FJ=0.48), 3 sigma needs N ~ 6,675-26,545 (canonical band ends, two-class y)
    -> gap x290-1,154. In-hand median z = 0.1-0.4: EXPLORATORY ONLY (firewalled).
  POWERED IF (the specific combination, all elements named):
    (i) internal-sigma errors <=10% on diffuse carriers  -> ELT-HARMONI-class IFU (~2032; NO 2026
        instrument reaches the 8-20 km/s carriers: DESI/SDSS/MUSE floors 23-64 km/s, census (B));
    (ii) FJ control held at the banked 0.15 floor (needs homogeneous distances/apertures -- the
        in-hand heterogeneous floor is 0.48 and would inflate N x7.5); and
    (iii) DESI-DR1-grade phase tagging (D=0.6; caustic infrastructure ALREADY public: HeCS-omnibus
        227 clusters + GalWCat19 + gfinder >=10^3 rich clusters)
    => N_3sigma = 343 (f=13%) to 1,454 (f=6%) carriers, i.e. 36-152 LEWIS-class cluster
    campaigns (10 usable carriers each); best realistic corner (tight FJ 0.08): 178 carriers.
    The cluster reservoir (227 phase-tagged) already covers the f>=10% half of the band at D=0.6;
    the CONSERVATIVE continuum-y fork multiplies all N by ~x3 (grid above) -- pre-register BOTH.
  STILL UNDERPOWERED (2026): YES -- the binding wall is carrier sigma precision, which no existing
    or imminent public release (incl. the NOT-public DESI DR2, verified 401) touches. Exact gap:
    23 in hand vs ~178-1,454 needed at a precision tier that first exists ~2032 (x8-63);
    vs ~6,675-26,545 at today's tier (x290-1,154).
  WHAT CLOSES IT: ELT-HARMONI first light (~2032) + a pre-registered target list built NOW for free
    (cross-match the DESI DR1 647k-dwarf VAC LSB tail vs HeCS-omnibus/gfinder clusters; tag infall
    phase from the public caustics; freeze THIS estimator). Both footings stay covered: the alt-a0
    band ends need x0.7-0.8 the N of canonical (grid) -- the discriminator is not footing-hostage.

 EXIT 0 = frozen-estimator MC calibrated (null exact, sqrt-N verified, banked analytic reproduced);
          verdict: STILL UNDERPOWERED in 2026; POWERED-IF combination named and quantified.
